<title>USA: Some US cash DAP prices soften on supply pressure.</title>
<headline>Some US cash DAP prices soften on supply pressure.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate (DAP) values were slightly lower on supply pressure, and ammonia prices were steady, cash dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;It's a supply thing right now,&quot; one dealer said. &quot;The margins have been so good that everybody was producing.&quot;</p>
<p>Farmers in Texas were top-dressing wheat, but no significant activity in the Midwest has started, sources said.</p>
<p>		     Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	  174-176		     dn 2</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf    186-188		     unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	  220-225		     unc</p>
